  "body": "Further code inspection and test-writing revealed that SVG `<a>` elements\r\nget a 0 default tabIndex in all engines, and `<embed>` and `<object>`\r\nelements get a 0 default tabIndex in Blink and WebKit. These were\r\nomitted in 15cf23a55d629e0b1286302c19634833a89292ab.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n   * Blink and WebKit already implement everything here; Gecko implements the SVG a portion\r\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/17657\r\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n   * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=982195, https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=982350\r\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1564541\r\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=199606\r\n\r\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHonestly I merged https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4754 prematurely. Given the rapidly-evolving state of my knowledge, and the refactoring I had to do for details which didn't get editorial review, I should not have merged that. My apologies. I can fix anything else wrong with #4754 here, as necessary.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n***\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4759/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 10, 2019, 3:56 PM UTC (835c686)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4759/15cf23a...835c686/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 10, 2019, 3:56 PM UTC (835c686)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4759/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 10, 2019, 3:56 PM UTC (835c686)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4759/15cf23a...835c686/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 10, 2019, 3:56 PM UTC (835c686)\">diff</a> )",
